{"timestamp": 1770699208118.6445, "start_timestamp": 1770699208030, "page": "pages3/findDetails/index", "request": {"url": "https://server-test.freeuuu.com/app-api/card/supplyDemand/get", "data": {"id": "2020996150090731521"}, "method": "GET", "header": {"content-type": "application/json", "loginCode": "0c1JcfGa1rH7aL05EkGa1PMy434JcfGl", "platform": "34", "longitude": 121.397, "latitude": 31.2494, "Authorization": "Bearer 9376ef5cc1e047d09f8f33d08f69de9d"}, "timeout": 120000}, "end_timestamp": 1770699208169, "response": {"data": {"code": 0, "data": {"id": "1960560586298163202", "userId": 1615, "name": "邵昆仑测试环境", "mobile": "17681122808", "avatar": "https://freeuuu.obs.cn-east-3.myhuaweicloud.com/stag/20251205/8c5377eea4f77e6b92207929d13a552f08e2d58145d7a6e04b4182f84ece5b39.jpg", "tag1": "上海福芮柚科技有限公司", "tag2": "测试", "identityId": "1967970973896331266", "identityType": 22, "email": "shaokunlun@freeuuu.com", "address": "上海市青浦区虹桥世界中心E幢3楼301室", "visitCount": 33, "exchangeStatus": -1, "cardType": 10, "contactId": null, "ipArea": "上海市", "persionalIntroduce": "我是一位热爱生活的体验家🎬，沉浸于电影世界探索多元人生，在光影叙事中为平凡日常注入诗意与温度🌿。我坚信真诚的联结能治愈孤独，用心与朋友相处，收获的不仅是陪伴更是灵魂共鸣的自由💫。\n\n我享受将生活过成诗的状态🌍，带着好奇奔赴清新旅行，在陌生街角捕捉\"good vibes only\"的小确幸，用镜头定格阳光洒落的美好瞬间☀️。音乐是我的情绪解药🎵，在旋律流淌中沉淀内心，收获身心舒展的舒适感。\n\n生活于我是一场持续发现美好的旅程✨，从电影想象到旅行真实，从音乐疗愈到友谊滋养，始终以热忱拥抱平凡中的不凡，让日子在热爱里闪闪发光🌟。", "isMine": true, "isOfficial": false, "cardShareImageUrl": "https://freeuuu.obs.cn-east-3.myhuaweicloud.com/test/image/20260210/24db8c5572ca9c1b71362a6ff23ebf56ffd6731f72d90f928ae609591d7e0f02.png", "memberStatus": true, "memberExpireDate": "2026/03/08", "supplyDemandId": "2020996150090731521", "cardId": "1960560586298163202", "title": "", "description": "最近在思考一个新的商业模式，想找几位朋友一起头脑风暴，碰撞不同的想法，不管是行业老手还是新人，都欢迎交流。", "type": "thinks", "createTime": 1770678005000, "dateTimeString": "5小时", "likeCount": 0, "replyCount": 0, "collectionCount": 0, "shareImageUrl": "https://freeuuu.obs.cn-east-3.myhuaweicloud.com/test/image/20260210/bd4b73ed52176df7551793cd28aa61019